<title>DENMARK: Coloplast 6-month profit rises.</title>
<headline>Coloplast 6-month profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net turnover	     1,112.3  vs  936.9</p>
<p> Group operating result	   129.6  vs  101.7</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result	     138.2  vs  110.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish medical group is Coloplast A/S. It said in a statement that it expected a 1996/97 ordinary result 15 percent higher the 1995/96 figure of 279.8 million crowns. The six-month result was above analysts' average expectations of a 127.6 million crown pre-tax profit. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
